{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "6ec22710-264f-85c4-8a94-9444ec38befc",
  "created_at": "2026-01-15T13:50:08-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Finance",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Ana Correia",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Luis Barros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T13:49:02-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Finance department, this is Luis. How can I help?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T13:49:05-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, Luis. Ana Correia. I'm told I'm a business owner, which is funny, because I mostly feel like a woman who lives in a warehouse. Sorry, I'm up on a mezzanine and the signal comes and goes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T13:49:16-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem. Go ahead, I'll tell you if you drop."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T13:49:20-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's my property tax bill. Can I pay just part of it now and the rest later? Or does that get me in trouble?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T13:49:27-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Generally the office will accept a partial payment, it just goes toward what you owe. Interest can keep building on whatever's left, though."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T13:49:34-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so not a [line breaks up] ... sorry, did you hear that? I also heard there's an exemption. What's the form number? I want to write it down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T13:49:43-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You cut out on the first part. Exemptions go through the assessor's office, and I don't have the form number in front of me. Want me to transfer you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T13:49:52-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Wait, so it isn't a finance form? I thought it was this department. I'm sorry, I'm a little lost."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T13:49:58-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Easy mistake. Assessor handles it. Hang on, I'll put you through, and if we lose you, call back and ask for them."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T13:50:05-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Thank you, Luis. I think I understand. Mostly."
    }
  ],
